Router\PYGZgt{}en
Router\PYGZsh{}conf t
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
Router(config)\PYGZsh{}router rip
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}version 2
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}network 172.84.18.224
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}passive\PYGZhy{}interface serial 2/0
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}passive\PYGZhy{}interface serial 3/0
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}redistribute ospf 100 met
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}redistribute ospf 100 metric 1
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}exit
Router(config)\PYGZsh{}router ospf 100
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}redistribute rip metric 200 subnet
Router(config\PYGZhy{}router)\PYGZsh{}passive\PYGZhy{}interface serial 9/0
